OL,5,G0532 Asia Specific
OL,6,     FChina's ability to scale up and
OL,7,     Flower costs for the masses has
OL,8,     Fnever been disputed. But does
OL,9,     FChina truly create inventions, or
OL,10,     Fdoes it excel at perfecting
OL,11,     Fpre-existing ideas?
OL,12,G0550 Sporting Witness
OL,13,     FManchester City fans became famous
OL,14,     Ffor an unusual sight on the
OL,15,     Fterraces: inflatable bananas.
OL,16,     FStarting as a joke it became one
OL,17,     Fof the most memorable fan crazes
OL,18,     Fin English football.
